  "body": "### Description\r\nI was purging a few thousand users an appbridge left behind, all with `{ \"erase\": true }`, but got `{\"errcode\":\"M_UNKNOWN\",\"error\":\"No row found (profiles)\"}` for a few dozen of them.\r\nWithout `erase: true`, I could successfully deactivate them.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n- Try to delete users with erase: true\r\n- Observe failure\r\n- Try to delete same users without erase: true\r\n- Observe success\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n- **Homeserver**:\r\nsynapse @ helsinki-systems.de\r\n- **Version**:\r\n`{\"server_version\":\"1.36.0\",\"python_version\":\"3.8.9\"}`\r\n- **Install method**:\r\nNixOS module\r\n- **Platform**:\r\nNixOS 21.05\r\n",
